A||||3||camon||Brake update and another problem fixed!||||10||
Z||000000||camon||12-01-2001||10:06 PM||||Well today I did my rear brake pad job (to take care of my rear driverside brake rattle) and it is now as quite as can be when going over bumps. <BR>Thank you Sqoach and Dan!!!!!!!!<P>I also replaced the fuel filter. I replaced it just because I was under there doing the brake job and thought it wouldn't hurt to replace it.<P>Well to my surprise it fixed a problem that my car had that I didn't think would have any bearing on the fuel filter but it must have.<BR>My car suffered from rough cold start up's and would hesitate pretty badly almost to the point of stalling when taking off and buck pretty bad while driving. This problem seemed to clear up after the car was run for like 20 minutes or so (that is why I doubted the fuel filter would cause it). Well now after the new fuel filter is on it runs great...no hesitiation and runs good when cold. It don't make sense....if the fuel filter is bad and would cause this hesitiation and poor cold running condition you would think the car would do it all the time....but it would clearup after 20 minutes or so......Don't ask me how.......but the fuel filter corrected this problem.<P>If anyone has hesitiation or poor  running when cold try to replace the fuel filter...IT WORKED FOR MINE!!!<P>------------------<BR>   Keith<BR>1987 Fiero GT||||reg||10
Z||000001||Dan010||12-01-2001||10:42 PM||||Great!!!!!!!!!!!<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||12-01-2001||10:54 PM||||I changed my filter recently.... you wouldn't beleive how much crap those things hold. They are built like little oil filter inside. (I carefully cut the old one open with a hack saw...)<P>A crapped up filter can cause low fuel pressure and flow. It can also overload the fuel pump and shorten it's life.<P>Why it only seems to affect cold starting I don't know for sure. Mine's been happier since changing the filter...<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Rumor||12-01-2001||11:36 PM||||Wow! Thanks for the tip, I have two cars that are in bad need for a fuel filter replacement.||||reg||1
